Adapted correspondence data from Heiko Hahn's Alphabetum Kaldeorum chart,
originally uploaded 2004-08-21, after Cod.4°810,fol.41v (1428).
Source: https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Alphabetum_Kaldeorum.jpg
License: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0/

Changes: independently replace the drawings with neutral source row/column/
variant transcription IDs; retain every displayed form and explicit U/V reading;
select the first source form deterministically. No artwork or font is included.
